<cm:compliance-solution>To establish the recommended configuration via GP, set the following UI path to Disabled:

User Configuration\Policies\Administrative Templates\Windows Components\Cloud Content\Configure Windows spotlight on lock screen

Note: This Group Policy path may not exist by default. It is provided by the Group Policy template CloudContent.admx/adml that is included with the Microsoft Windows 10 Release 1607 &amp; Server 2016 Administrative Templates (or newer).

Default Value:

Enabled. (Windows Spotlight is set as the lock screen provider.)</cm:compliance-solution>
