<cm:compliance-check-name>18.10.93.2.2 Ensure &apos;Configure Automatic Updates: Scheduled install day&apos; is set to &apos;0 - Every day&apos;</cm:compliance-check-name>
<cm:compliance-check-id>719ce2f935dac08a67bde967a8fabf687bacda41334606eda727cb6715a7f9de</cm:compliance-check-id>
