<cm:compliance-functional-id>7d6a96e225</cm:compliance-functional-id>
<cm:compliance-info>This setting enables or disables the automatic download and installation of Microsoft Store app updates.

The recommended state for this setting is: Disabled.

Rationale:

Keeping your system properly patched can help protect against 0 day vulnerabilities.

Impact:

None - this is the default behavior.</cm:compliance-info>
<cm:compliance-result>FAILED</cm:compliance-result>
