<cm:compliance-benchmark-version>2.0.0</cm:compliance-benchmark-version>
<cm:compliance-check-name>18.10.59.4 Ensure &apos;Allow Cortana above lock screen&apos; is set to &apos;Disabled&apos;</cm:compliance-check-name>
<cm:compliance-check-id>dc1f7da213294a06957ad974ce84d501abdb5a6b422c228858c00b39fb178994</cm:compliance-check-id>
<cm:compliance-actual-value>NULL</cm:compliance-actual-value>
<cm:compliance-source>custom</cm:compliance-source>
<cm:compliance-audit-file>CIS_MS_Windows_10_Enterprise_Level_1_v2.0.0.audit</cm:compliance-audit-file>
<cm:compliance-policy-value>0</cm:compliance-policy-value>
<cm:compliance-functional-id>253f668ebf</cm:compliance-functional-id>
<cm:compliance-info>This policy setting determines whether or not the user can interact with Cortana using speech while the system is locked.

The recommended state for this setting is: Disabled.

Rationale:

Access to any computer resource should not be allowed when the device is locked.

Impact:

The system will need to be unlocked for the user to interact with Cortana using speech.</cm:compliance-info>
<cm:compliance-result>FAILED</cm:compliance-result>
<cm:compliance-informational-id>4e221ff8a2066a79a9a91b075f3cf18ab6fb83c1d2a58e6b1933127a489f7467</cm:compliance-informational-id>
<cm:compliance-reference>800-171|3.4.2,800-171|3.4.6,800-171|3.4.7,800-53|CM-6,800-53|CM-7,800-53r5|CM-6,800-53r5|CM-7,CSCv7|16.11,CSCv8|4.8,CSF|PR.IP-1,CSF|PR.PT-3,GDPR|32.1.b,HIPAA|164.306(a)(1),ITSG-33|CM-6,ITSG-33|CM-7,LEVEL|1A,NIAv2|SS15a,PCI-DSSv3.2.1|2.2.2,SWIFT-CSCv1|2.3</cm:compliance-reference>
<cm:compliance-solution>To establish the recommended configuration via GP, set the following UI path to Disabled:

Computer Configuration\Policies\Administrative Templates\Windows Components\Search\Allow Cortana above lock screen

Note: This Group Policy path may not exist by default. It is provided by the Group Policy template Search.admx/adml that is included with the Microsoft Windows 10 Release 1607 &amp; Server 2016 Administrative Templates (or newer).

Default Value:

Enabled. (The user can interact with Cortana using speech while the system is locked.)</cm:compliance-solution>
<cm:compliance-benchmark-name>CIS Microsoft Windows 10 Benchmark L1</cm:compliance-benchmark-name>
<cm:compliance-control-id>aae65ddfc18794223eebaa9f860aa76c35ec1adf3373069debff673c1e4844a0</cm:compliance-control-id>
