<cm:compliance-functional-id>582cc599f2</cm:compliance-functional-id>
<cm:compliance-info>This policy setting controls Microsoft Defender Exploit Guard network protection.

The recommended state for this setting is: Enabled: Block.

Rationale:

This setting can help prevent employees from using any application to access dangerous domains that may host phishing scams, exploit-hosting sites, and other malicious content on the Internet.

Impact:

Users and applications will not be able to access dangerous domains.</cm:compliance-info>
<cm:compliance-result>FAILED</cm:compliance-result>
<cm:compliance-informational-id>8db6966d69d514e6ca9e9035f8234c724db4d9829118d2c627c02e53096b1bfb</cm:compliance-informational-id>
