<cm:compliance-functional-id>86934bcc1c</cm:compliance-functional-id>
<cm:compliance-info>This policy setting controls whether Windows attempts to connect with the OneSettings service to download configuration settings.

The recommended state for this setting is: Enabled.

Rationale:

Sending data to a third-party vendor is a security concern and should only be done on an as-needed basis.

Impact:

Windows will not connect to the OneSettings service to download configuration settings.</cm:compliance-info>
