<cm:compliance-check-name>17.3.1 Ensure &apos;Audit PNP Activity&apos; is set to include &apos;Success&apos;</cm:compliance-check-name>
<cm:compliance-check-id>9eb5e97247ad6f943d966ad1ed01ce8fb6b26cd619414764bd9a65dec9d4819a</cm:compliance-check-id>
<cm:compliance-actual-value>&apos;no auditing&apos;</cm:compliance-actual-value>
