<cm:compliance-check-name>17.2.1 Ensure &apos;Audit Application Group Management&apos; is set to &apos;Success and Failure&apos;</cm:compliance-check-name>
<cm:compliance-check-id>896ba2441317edbd0c38c6db27f572de5c31f3e9b2091d517628e45431b67673</cm:compliance-check-id>
<cm:compliance-actual-value>&apos;no auditing&apos;</cm:compliance-actual-value>
