<cm:compliance-solution>To establish the recommended configuration via GP, set the following UI path to %SystemRoot%\System32\logfiles\firewall\publicfw.log:

Computer Configuration\Policies\Windows Settings\Security Settings\Windows Firewall with Advanced Security\Windows Firewall with Advanced Security\Windows Firewall Properties\Public Profile\Logging Customize\Name

Default Value:

%SystemRoot%\System32\logfiles\firewall\pfirewall.log</cm:compliance-solution>
