<cm:compliance-functional-id>10a72eebdf</cm:compliance-functional-id>
<cm:compliance-info>This setting determines the behavior for inbound connections that do not match an inbound firewall rule.

The recommended state for this setting is: Block (default).

Rationale:

If the firewall allows all traffic to access the system then an attacker may be more easily able to remotely exploit a weakness in a network service.

Impact:

None - this is the default behavior.</cm:compliance-info>
<cm:compliance-result>FAILED</cm:compliance-result>
