<cm:compliance-check-name>2.3.11.9 Ensure &apos;Network security: Minimum session security for NTLM SSP based (including secure RPC) clients&apos; is set to &apos;Require NTLMv2 session security, Require 128-bit encryption&apos;</cm:compliance-check-name>
<cm:compliance-check-id>8eaca9bafa6552c9099dc695a1859191d775fd4d199f174df3466e639eb4074d</cm:compliance-check-id>
<cm:compliance-actual-value>536870912</cm:compliance-actual-value>
