<cm:compliance-check-name>18.9.19.5 Ensure &apos;Turn off background refresh of Group Policy&apos; is set to &apos;Disabled&apos;</cm:compliance-check-name>
<cm:compliance-check-id>b7bbb500868aef28d6d41e2973116391bf0ace05afa5c6211c205ac650ff4bad</cm:compliance-check-id>
