<cm:compliance-solution>To establish the recommended configuration via GP, set the following UI path to Administrators, Window Manager\Window Manager Group:

Computer Configuration\Policies\Windows Settings\Security Settings\Local Policies\User Rights Assignment\Increase scheduling priority

Default Value:

On Windows 10 R1607 or older: Administrators.

On Windows 10 R1703 or newer: Administrators, Window Manager\Window Manager Group.</cm:compliance-solution>
