<cm:compliance-check-name>2.2.10 Ensure &apos;Create a pagefile&apos; is set to &apos;Administrators&apos;</cm:compliance-check-name>
<cm:compliance-check-id>ea206a4d06e221ada5af19a1920f42819fabb06e3c6054595aa8aa473a9f358f</cm:compliance-check-id>
<cm:compliance-actual-value>&apos;administrators&apos;</cm:compliance-actual-value>
