<cm:compliance-check-id>f3b58a51c5e4315d85082862db1aa92316731fec60a68de791b33268d115e101</cm:compliance-check-id>
<cm:compliance-actual-value>The command &apos;sysctl net.ipv4.conf.all.send_redirects&apos; returned : 

net.ipv4.conf.all.send_redirects = 1</cm:compliance-actual-value>
