<cm:compliance-solution>Run the following command to set permissions on /etc/group- :

# chown root:root /etc/group-
# chmod u-x,go-wx /etc/group-</cm:compliance-solution>
<cm:compliance-benchmark-name>CIS Distribution Independent Linux Server L1</cm:compliance-benchmark-name>
