<cm:compliance-solution>Run the one of the following chown commands as appropriate and the chmod to set
permissions on /etc/shadow :

# chown root:root /etc/shadow
# chown root:shadow /etc/shadow
# chmod o-rwx,g-wx /etc/shadow</cm:compliance-solution>
