<cm:compliance-check-id>2d53af82f6a9446100b47270c812e92ebaa59370beae5417ed5807ac455fb70a</cm:compliance-check-id>
<cm:compliance-actual-value>The file /etc/ssh/ssh_host_ecdsa_key.pub with fmode owner: root group: root mode: 0644 uid: 0 gid: 0 uneven permissions : FALSE is compliant with the policy value 
The file /etc/ssh/ssh_host_ed25519_key.pub with fmode owner: root group: root mode: 0644 uid: 0 gid: 0 uneven permissions : FALSE is compliant with the policy value 
The file /etc/ssh/ssh_host_rsa_key.pub with fmode owner: root group: root mode: 0644 uid: 0 gid: 0 uneven permissions : FALSE is compliant with the policy value 

/etc/ssh/ssh_host_ecdsa_key.pub, /etc/ssh/ssh_host_ed25519_key.pub, /etc/ssh/ssh_host_rsa_key.pub</cm:compliance-actual-value>
