<cm:compliance-solution>Run one of the following commands to disable snmpd:

# chkconfig snmpd off

# systemctl disable snmpd

# update-rc.d snmpd disable

Notes:

Additional methods of disabling a service exist. Consult your distribution documentation
for appropriate methods.</cm:compliance-solution>
