<cm:compliance-solution>Run one of the following commands to disable smb :

# chkconfig smb off

# systemctl disable smb

# update-rc.d smb disable

Notes:

Additional methods of disabling a service exist. Consult your distribution documentation
for appropriate methods.

On some distributions the samba service is known as samba, not smb.</cm:compliance-solution>
