<cm:compliance-solution>Run one of the following commands to disable nfs and rpcbind :

# chkconfig nfs off
# chkconfig rpcbind off

# systemctl disable nfs
# systemctl disable rpcbind

# update-rc.d nfs disable
# update-rc.d rpcbind disable

Notes:

Additional methods of disabling a service exist. Consult your distribution documentation
for appropriate methods.</cm:compliance-solution>
