<cm:compliance-solution>Comment out or remove any lines starting with telnet from /etc/inetd.conf and
/etc/inetd.d/* .
Set disable = yes on all telnet services in /etc/xinetd.conf and /etc/xinetd.d/* .</cm:compliance-solution>
