<cm:compliance-uname>Linux ubuntu 5.15.0-84-generic #93-Ubuntu SMP Tue Sep 5 17:16:10 UTC 2023 x86_64 x86_64 x86_64 GNU/Linux</cm:compliance-uname>
<cm:compliance-info>Sometimes when administrators delete users or groups from the system they neglect to remove all files owned by those users or groups.

Rationale:

A new user who is assigned the deleted user&apos;s user ID or group ID may then end up &apos;owning&apos; these files, and thus have more access on the system than was intended.</cm:compliance-info>
<cm:compliance-result>FAILED</cm:compliance-result>
<cm:compliance-informational-id>5b1ef3b1dd0a68606f8a843668397c4b907a625387cc6f334729aec4b60bf8e5</cm:compliance-informational-id>
