<cm:compliance-uname>Linux ubuntu 5.15.0-84-generic #93-Ubuntu SMP Tue Sep 5 17:16:10 UTC 2023 x86_64 x86_64 x86_64 GNU/Linux</cm:compliance-uname>
<cm:compliance-info>The Banner parameter specifies a file whose contents must be sent to the remote user before authentication is permitted. By default, no banner is displayed.

Rationale:

Banners are used to warn connecting users of the particular site&apos;s policy regarding connection. Presenting a warning message prior to the normal user login may assist the prosecution of trespassers on the computer system.</cm:compliance-info>
<cm:compliance-result>FAILED</cm:compliance-result>
<cm:compliance-informational-id>7750bed2eae3206a3205f33988ae8d448130861676af90872b12ea60d0fceb1f</cm:compliance-informational-id>
