<cm:compliance-actual-value>The file /boot/grub/grub.cfg with fmode owner: root group: root mode: 0644 uid: 0 gid: 0 uneven permissions : FALSE  does not match the policy value owner: root group: root mask: 377 uneven permissions : FALSE 

/boot/grub/grub.cfg</cm:compliance-actual-value>
