<cm:compliance-full-id>5c6e5a5ccdf3d612a72fc2b1a9a30f0e93468cc8b2e5ebb566a403be5ce0f4e9</cm:compliance-full-id>
<cm:compliance-error>CMD_EXEC_CHECKS do not work against the localhost - try from a different host or in command-line</cm:compliance-error>
