<cm:compliance-info>Audit configuration files control auditd and what events are audited.

Rationale:

Access to the audit configuration files could allow unauthorized personnel to prevent the auditing of critical events.

Misconfigured audit configuration files may prevent the auditing of critical events or impact the system&apos;s performance by overwhelming the audit log. Misconfiguration of the audit configuration files may also make it more difficult to establish and investigate events relating to an incident.</cm:compliance-info>
<cm:compliance-result>ERROR</cm:compliance-result>
<cm:compliance-informational-id>032d6fb4e1953fa2e85e9ddf08c1b60e70883b70d3f152775096f16955ecd336</cm:compliance-informational-id>
