<cm:compliance-info>When enabled, this feature logs packets with un-routable source addresses to the kernel log.

Rationale:

Enabling this feature and logging these packets by setting:

net.ipv4.conf.all.log_martians = 1

net.ipv4.conf.default.log_martians = 1

allows an administrator to investigate the possibility that an attacker is sending spoofed packets to their system.</cm:compliance-info>
<cm:compliance-result>ERROR</cm:compliance-result>
