<cm:compliance-info>Remote Procedure Call (RPC) is a method for creating low level client server applications across different system architectures. It requires an RPC compliant client listening on a network port. The supporting package is rpcbind.&apos;

Rationale:

If RPC is not required, it is recommended that this services be removed to reduce the remote attack surface.</cm:compliance-info>
