<cm:compliance-benchmark-version>1.0.0</cm:compliance-benchmark-version>
<cm:compliance-check-name>2.2.10 Ensure IMAP and POP3 server are not installed - dovecot-pop3d</cm:compliance-check-name>
<cm:compliance-check-id>d8ab88548bb5ee3bbf6276cb2731d6db85cc563f9c8659ab19799e23cfb5a7af</cm:compliance-check-id>
<cm:compliance-source>custom</cm:compliance-source>
<cm:compliance-audit-file>CIS_Ubuntu_22.04_LTS_v1.0.0_Server_L1.audit</cm:compliance-audit-file>
<cm:compliance-functional-id>9739db5ffe</cm:compliance-functional-id>
<cm:compliance-uname>Linux ubuntu 5.15.0-84-generic #93-Ubuntu SMP Tue Sep 5 17:16:10 UTC 2023 x86_64 x86_64 x86_64 GNU/Linux</cm:compliance-uname>
<cm:compliance-info>dovecot-imapd and dovecot-pop3d are an open source IMAP and POP3 server for Linux based systems.

Rationale:

Unless POP3 and/or IMAP servers are to be provided by this system, it is recommended that the package be removed to reduce the potential attack surface.</cm:compliance-info>
<cm:compliance-result>ERROR</cm:compliance-result>
<cm:compliance-informational-id>a2b52bd406db22d84d729856b1aa8223d52a2ed743d5e0db48ea73828494abf5</cm:compliance-informational-id>
<cm:compliance-reference>800-171|3.4.2,800-171|3.4.6,800-171|3.4.7,800-53|CM-6,800-53|CM-7,800-53r5|CM-6,800-53r5|CM-7,CSCv7|9.2,CSCv8|4.8,CSF|PR.IP-1,CSF|PR.PT-3,GDPR|32.1.b,HIPAA|164.306(a)(1),ITSG-33|CM-6,ITSG-33|CM-7,LEVEL|1A,NIAv2|SS15a,PCI-DSSv3.2.1|2.2.2,SWIFT-CSCv1|2.3</cm:compliance-reference>
<cm:compliance-solution>Run one of the following commands to remove dovecot-imapd and dovecot-pop3d:

# apt purge dovecot-imapd dovecot-pop3d

Additional Information:

Several IMAP/POP3 servers exist and can use other service names. courier-imap and cyrus-imap are example services that provide a mail server. These and other services should also be audited.</cm:compliance-solution>
<cm:compliance-benchmark-name>CIS Ubuntu Linux 22.04 LTS Server L1</cm:compliance-benchmark-name>
<cm:compliance-control-id>9f3620834189b4b52f1030dc6eab9b2c1c15b47c49bcc96040b7e61982f5a1bc</cm:compliance-control-id>
<cm:compliance-see-also>https://workbench.cisecurity.org/files/4068</cm:compliance-see-also>
<cm:compliance-full-id>d8ab88548bb5ee3bbf6276cb2731d6db85cc563f9c8659ab19799e23cfb5a7af</cm:compliance-full-id>
<cm:compliance-error>CMD_EXEC_CHECKS do not work against the localhost - try from a different host or in command-line</cm:compliance-error>
</ReportItem>
