<cm:compliance-info>The Domain Name System (DNS) is a hierarchical naming system that maps names to IP addresses for computers, services and other resources connected to a network.

Rationale:

Unless a system is specifically designated to act as a DNS server, it is recommended that the package be deleted to reduce the potential attack surface.</cm:compliance-info>
<cm:compliance-result>ERROR</cm:compliance-result>
