<cm:compliance-solution>IF the /var/tmp partition exists, edit the /etc/fstab file and add nodev to the fourth field (mounting options) for the /var/tmp partition.
Example:

&lt;device&gt; /var/tmp    &lt;fstype&gt;     defaults,rw,nosuid,nodev,noexec,relatime  0 0

Run the following command to remount /var/tmp with the configured options:

# mount -o remount /var/tmp</cm:compliance-solution>
