<cm:compliance-solution>IF the /var partition exists, edit the /etc/fstab file and add nodev to the fourth field (mounting options) for the /var partition.
Example:

&lt;device&gt; /var    &lt;fstype&gt;     defaults,rw,nosuid,nodev,relatime  0 0

Run the following command to remount /var with the configured options:

# mount -o remount /var</cm:compliance-solution>
