      /etc/shadow - regex &apos;^[^:]+:[^!*]&apos; found - expect &apos;^([^:]*:){5}([7-9]|[1-9][0-9]+):&apos; found in the following lines:
          32: student:$6$z.ql/qSe7Rqk.wzH$11HTKpiAVxOdWaU3p.A3Iixl/hUWXRQAjMBOXrHvQC7tsJ1CiM.Nj0s88X4tJpLBkaHWAmvKG6WZSZGAhpViR0:19361:0:99999:7:::
