<cm:compliance-actual-value>The file /etc/ssh/ssh_host_dsa_key with fmode owner: root group: root mode: 0600 uid: 0 gid: 0 uneven permissions : FALSE is compliant with the policy value 
The file /etc/ssh/ssh_host_ecdsa_key with fmode owner: root group: root mode: 0600 uid: 0 gid: 0 uneven permissions : FALSE is compliant with the policy value 
