<cm:compliance-solution>Edit either /etc/rsyslog.conf or a dedicated .conf file in /etc/rsyslog.d/ and set $FileCreateMode to 0640 or more restrictive:

$FileCreateMode 0640

Restart the service:

# systemctl restart rsyslog</cm:compliance-solution>
