<cm:compliance-uname>Linux ubuntu 5.15.0-84-generic #93-Ubuntu SMP Tue Sep 5 17:16:10 UTC 2023 x86_64 x86_64 x86_64 GNU/Linux</cm:compliance-uname>
<cm:compliance-info>Data from journald should be kept in the confines of the service and not forwarded on to other services.

Rationale:

IF journald is the method for capturing logs, all logs of the system should be handled by journald and not forwarded to other logging mechanisms.</cm:compliance-info>
<cm:compliance-result>PASSED</cm:compliance-result>
