<cm:compliance-solution>Run the following command to unmask the ufw daemon:

# systemctl unmask ufw.service

Run the following command to enable and start the ufw daemon:

# systemctl --now enable ufw.service

active

Run the following command to enable ufw:

# ufw enable</cm:compliance-solution>
