      /boot/grub/grub.cfg - regex &apos;^[\s]*linux[\s]*&apos; found - expect &apos;[Ss][Ee][Cc][Uu][Rr][Ii][Tt][Yy]=[^Aa][^Pp][^Pp][^Aa][^Rr][^Mm][^Oo][^Rr]&apos; not found in the following lines:
